        "explanation": "Provides final executable discharge medication, wound-care, red-flag, service and follow-up plan.",
        "quote": "出院后3天准时回烧伤伤口门诊换药复查"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00741",
        "explanation": "Shows patient-family teach-back and residual clarification consistent with the given threshold framework.",
        "quote": "我们俩照着您说的再对一下"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode reached a safe discharge-transition closure: the patient and family had medication instructions, wound-care boundaries, burn wound clinic follow-up timing, and urgent return thresholds. The final patient clarification about what counts as a large soak was within the already explained threshold of whole/large dressing saturation versus small edge drainage, not an unmitigated blocking risk.",
