          "explanation": "Corrects the misconception that any yellow edge drainage is necessarily dangerous while preserving urgent thresholds.",
          "quote": "如果只是**边缘少量渗黄色渗液**"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "Corrects the patient's interpretation of culture growth and antibiotic timing in patient-friendly language.",
          "quote": "培养初步有细菌生长不代表现在的消炎药没用"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
