          "quote": "外层纱布整片湿透、伤口发出明显臭味、皮肤红肿范围变大"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00417",
          "explanation": "Explains that small clear drainage is not automatically a reason to overcall failure or infection.",
          "quote": "还有少量渗液，不代表一定不能植皮"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor avoided both overcalling all drainage as infection and undercalling risk, repeatedly using drainage amount/quality, odor, redness, fever/chills, pain trend, toe perfusion/sensation, and clinician measurement to guide action.",
