          "explanation": "Converts family-teaching concerns into an executable plan for caregiver instruction.",
          "quote": "可以让护士示范的时候，您和家属一起跟着一步步说、一步步核对"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor moved beyond simply saying 'go to hospital' by offering transport alternatives, neighbor/property assistance, family involvement, and discharge teaching strategies that made the plan executable.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
