          "explanation": "Immediately reframes chills and worsened wound odor as possible infection in a deep electric burn.",
          "quote": "需要警惕感染可能"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Directs the patient toward in-person evaluation rather than routine dressing advice.",
          "quote": "尽快回医院让医生当面评估处理"
