          "explanation": "Asks about fever measurement in the context of chills.",
          "quote": "发冷的时候有没有测过体温，有没有发烧"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00210",
          "explanation": "Later reinforces systemic danger symptoms requiring immediate staff response.",
          "quote": "再次发冷打颤、体温升高"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor assessed and repeatedly acted on systemic infection warning signs, including chills/fever and later inpatient vital-sign changes, without using an absent or uncertain measurement to reassure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
