          "quote": "有没有明显红肿、痛得比之前厉害"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00727",
          "explanation": "Explains dangerous wound changes versus minor drainage.",
          "quote": "整片湿透、伤口发出明显臭味、皮肤红肿范围变大"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor elicited and explained wound worsening signals, including redness, pain, drainage amount, odor and rapid saturation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
