          "explanation": "Requests the patient provide discharge papers and ointment for verification.",
          "quote": "出院单和药膏您可以主动拿给接诊的医生或护士看"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00727",
          "explanation": "Reconciles discharge oral antibiotic and analgesic use with frequency and limits.",
